0.\n$$\n\nSo our general solution reduces to\n\n$$\ny=R\\operatorname{sin}⁡3t.\n$$\n\nWe're told that the velocity is $6\\,\\text{m/s}$ when $t=0,$ which means that ${y}^{′}(0)=6.$ Differentiating the general solution with respect to $t$ gives\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}=3R\\operatorname{cos}⁡3t.\n$$\n\nSubstituting ${y}^{′}(0)=6$ into the above gives\n\n$$\n6=3R\\,⟹\\,R=2.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the amplitude is $2\\,\\text{m}.$ The solution for $y(t)$ is\n\n$$\ny(t)=2\\operatorname{sin}⁡3t.\n$$" 13194139535412 true] [17592186347848 1000 #edb/ref 17592186347849 13194139535412 true] [17592186347848 1000 #edb/ref 17592186347850 13194139535412 true] [17592186347848 1000 #edb/ref 17592186347851 13194139535412 true] [17592186347848 1000 #edb/ref 17592186347852 13194139535412 true] [17592186347848 1000 #edb/ref 17592186347853 13194139535412 true] [17592186347848 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535412 true] [17592186347848 1041 "selection" 13194139535412 true] [17592186347848 1104 #edb/ref 17592186347853 13194139535412 true] [17592186347848 1110 #uuid "d17d438e-89ca-5ae1-8f9b-aa4f60df8942" 13194139535412 true] [17592186347849 1034 "\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\text{m}" 13194139535412 true] [17592186347849 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535412 true] [17592186347849 1111 #uuid "538663fb-1e95-5331-bcba-362600490501" 13194139535412 true] [17592186347850 1034 "\\frac{2}{3}\\,\\text{m}" 13194139535412 true] [17592186347850 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535412 true] [17592186347850 1111 #uuid "8bb97c6f-fa22-54b4-9207-eaad2a3fdc23" 13194139535412 true] [17592186347851 1034 "6\\,\\text{m}" 13194139535412 true] [17592186347851 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535412 true] [17592186347851 1111 #uuid "b0857941-97d3-533d-adbd-03f501d0585f" 13194139535412 true] [17592186347852 1034 "\\frac{1}{3}\\,\\text{m}" 13194139535412 true] [17592186347852 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535412 true] [17592186347852 1111 #uuid "5dd28336-979b-5ffd-b4eb-ae1b39767cfc" 13194139535412 true] [1759218634785