 The spring constant associated with the spring is $k=21\\,{\\text{kg/s}}^{2}.$ The position of the particle is $y(t)$ (measured in meters), and $t>0$ is the time in seconds. \n\nIf the particle moves with simple harmonic motion, then which of the following statements are true?\n\n- The governing differential equation is ${y}^{″}+3y=0$\n- The frequency $f$ of the oscillation is $f=\\frac{3}{2\\pi }\\,{\\text{s}}^{-1}$\n- The general solution can be expressed as $y=R\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3t+ϕ),$ where $R$ is the amplitude and $ϕ$ is the phase." 13194139535412 true] [17592186347931 1113 #uuid "0f7fe2d4-f6a4-50af-961e-e17d97fe8283" 13194139535412 true] [17592186347931 1145 "Let's look at each statement in turn.\n\n- The equation of motion for a particle of mass $m$ moving with simple harmonic motion (SHM) under the action of a spring with spring constant $k$ is given by\n\n$$\nm{y}^{″}=-ky.\n$$\n\nRearranging the above equation gives\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}+\\frac{k}{m}y=0.\n$$\n\nComparing this to the SHM equation \n\n$$\n{y}^{″}+{\\omega }^{2}y=0,\n$$\n\nwe see that\n\n$$\n{\\omega }^{2}=\\frac{k}{m}.\n$$\n\nSubstituting our values for $k$ and $m$ gives\n\n$$\n{\\omega }^{2}=\\frac{21}{7}=3\\,⟹\\,\\omega =\\sqrt{3}.\n$$\n\nSo the governing differential equation is\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}+3y=0.\n$$\n\nHence, statement I is true.\n\n- The frequency $f$ (measured in ${s}^{-1}$) is given by\n\n$$\nf=\\frac{1}{T}=\\frac{\\omega }{2\\pi },\n$$\n\nwhere $T$ is the period. So in our case, we have\n\n$$\nf=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2\\pi }\\,.\n$$\n\nSo the frequency $f=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2\\pi }\\,{\\text{s}}^{-1}.$\nHence, statement II is false.\n\n- The general solution for $y(t)$ can take one of three forms.\n\n- $A\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\omega t+B\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\omega t$\n\n- $R\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\omega t+{ϕ}_{1})$\n\n- $R\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\omega t+{ϕ}_{2})$\n\nWriting $\\omega =\\sqrt{3}$ and ${ϕ}_{1}=ϕ$ in form 2 gives\n\n$$\ny(t)=R\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\sqrt{3}t+ϕ).\n$$\n\nHence, statement III is false.\n\nSo, the correct answer is \"I only\"." 13194139535412 true] [17592186347932 1000 #edb/ref 17592186347933 13194139535412 true] [17592186347932 1000 #edb/ref 17592186347934 13194139535412 true] [17592186347932 1000 #edb/ref 17592186347935 13194139535412 true] [17592186347932 1000 #edb/ref 17592186347936 13194139535412 true] [17592186347932 1000 #edb/ref 17592186347937 13194139535412 true] [17592186347932 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535412 true] [17592186347932 1041 "selection" 13194139535412 true] [17592186347932 1104 #edb/ref 17592186347934 13194139535412 true] [17592186347932 1110 #uuid "c0b50ba6-2aec-59c1-9d00-713d93c0c76b" 13194139535412 true] [17592186347933 1034 "II and III only" 13194139535412 true] [17592186347933 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535412 true] [17592186347933 1111 #uuid "6214187d-fbb8-5d95-bb10-eec3670ddd81" 13194139535412 true] [17592186347934 1034 "I only" 13194139535412 true] [17592186347934 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535412 true] [17592186347934 1111 #uuid "03177b05-c611-5c39-b9b3-f9028491d1d0" 13194139535412 true] [17592186347935 1034 "III only" 13194139535412 true] [17592186347935 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535412 true] [17592186347935 1111 #uuid "b8c0bfcf-9723-5eca-9ea5-e95139a819b1" 13194139535412 true] [17592186347936 1034 "I and II only" 13194139535412 true] [17592186347936 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535412 true] [17592186347936 1111 #uuid "d2d9e126-9c48-553c-8a46-6c9fe84ed935" 13194139535412 true] [17592186347937 1034 "II only" 13194139535412 true] [17592186347937 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535412 true] [17592186347937 1111 #uuid "749cfb50-e0b2-5973-b973-f49a432481bd" 13194139535412 true]] :edb/tempids {"q-64247" 17592186347791 "q-64247/selection" 17592186347792 "q-64247/selection/350fdcfa14048b48e169c8e988d0d1f05047b773320b49620e04618ae8bb54eb" 17592186347793 "q-64247/selection/81b9ad28db034107403588e78352c070f71ae552c52a7a5637827703485dd0a3" 17592186347794 